ve service configuration and connection status without changing the scene.", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {}, "additionalProperties": false}}, {"name": "human_eye_clearance_segment", "description": "Preview or execute a finite target-clearance segment. Legacy requests use exact world-axis boxes with an explicit signed world axis. Explicit solver=support_plane requests select an original reference triangle and a world translation direction; exact finite-plane certificates restrict their supported convex-mesh domain. Supply object IDs, target and tolerance; the engine computes translations and may correct confirmed residuals within the declared budget. execute defaults to false. Reuse the same request_id to retrieve a historical receipt, never to repeat motion. Every real step retains fresh geometry/precision checks and actual readback. Endpoint only; no swept path or in-flight cancellation is certified.", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"session_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "request_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "request": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "description": "A bounded goal request, never execution permission. Use the legacy explicit world-axis box constraint, or solver=support_plane with an explicitly selected original reference triangle and world direction. Each actual step still needs fresh whole-scene checks and readback.", "required": ["focal_id", "reference_id", "target_clearance_m", "clearance_tolerance_m"], "properties": {"focal_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "reference_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "axis": {"type": "string", "enum": ["+x", "-x", "+y", "-y", "+z", "-z"]}, "target_clearance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "clearance_tolerance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "max_steps": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 8, "default": 4}, "max_step_translation_m": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 1, "default": 0.01}, "max_total_translation_m": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 4, "default": 0.04}, "max_duration_s": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 30, "default": 5}, "reference_triangle_index": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0}, "direction_world": {"type": "array", "minItems": 3, "maxItems": 3, "items": {"type": "number"}}, "solver": {"type": "string", "enum": ["support_plane"]}, "selection_binding": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["scene_revision", "scene_fingerprint", "focal_id", "reference_id"], "description": "Initial captured-scene freshness and pair binding, never execution authority or verified user intent. Later steps retain their separate fresh checks.", "properties": {"scene_revision": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "scene_fingerprint": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}, "focal_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "reference_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}}}}, "oneOf": [{"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["focal_id", "reference_id", "axis", "target_clearance_m", "clearance_tolerance_m"], "description": "A bounded goal request, never an execution permission. Version one supports exact world-axis box faces only. Axis points from reference toward focal; each correction may move either way along that axis.", "properties": {"focal_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "reference_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "axis": {"type": "string", "enum": ["+x", "-x", "+y", "-y", "+z", "-z"]}, "target_clearance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "clearance_tolerance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "max_steps": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 8, "default": 4}, "max_step_translation_m": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 1, "default": 0.01}, "max_tota